{"slug": "volume3/010", "title": "Kinds of travelling allowance.", "volume": "volume3", "sourceUrl": "https://budget.up.nic.in/Fin_H_Book/volume3/010.HTML", "html": "<font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"6\">\n<p align=\"CENTER\"></p></font><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"5\">CHAPTER III\n</font><font color=\"#00ff00\" size=\"3\">\n<p></p></font><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#808000\">RULES FOR ORDINARY JOURNEYS</font>\n<p></p></font><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#800000\">22. Travelling allowances are of the\nfollowing kinds :</font>\n<p><font color=\"#800000\">(1) Mileage allowances for travel by rail.</font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#800000\">(2) Mileage allowances for travel by road.</font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#800000\">(3) Mileage allowances for travel by air.</font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#800000\">(4) Daily allowances.</font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#800000\">(5) Permanent monthly allowances.</font></p></font><font color=\"#00ff00\" size=\"4\">\n</font>\n<p>                           \n<a href=\"financial%20handbook1.html\" target=\"_top\"></a>    <a href=\"../../../upfinance/finhomemain.htm\" target=\"_top\"></a></p>"}